  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components, distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml in Balch--type tubes), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. After autoclaving, aseptically add per liter the following solutions (filter--sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Replace the gas phase with a N2--CO2--O2 (80:20:3, v/v/v) gas mixture and pressurize to 200 kPa with the same gas mixture."
    }
  ]
